/ Flutter state / T04</td><td>E <code>lib/features/station_content/presentation/controllers/station_content_controller.dart</code>; E <code>lib/features/station_content/presentation/controllers/station_content_state.dart</code>; E <code>lib/app/providers.dart</code>; E <code>test/features/station_content/presentation/station_content_controller_test.dart</code>; E <code>test/support/development_fixtures.dart</code></td><td>Update both known fake repository owners; loadMore/retry/generation; providers remain composition-only. Serialize providers with WO-02</td></tr><tr><td>03-T06 / Flutter UI / T05,T08</td><td>E <code>lib/features/station_content/presentation/program_details_screen.dart</code>; E <code>lib/features/station_content/presentation/widgets/station_programs_tab.dart</code>; E <code>lib/features/station_details/presentation/station_details_screen.dart</code>; E <code>test/features/station_content/presentation/program_details_view_test.dart</code>; E <code>test/features/station_details/presentation/station_details_view_test.dart</code></td><td>Open a program through its page query rather than assuming station batch completeness; RTL/font/keyboard navigation and append errors. Shared ProgramDetails work serializes with WO-04 counter UI</td></tr><tr><td>03-T07 / Flutter navigation / T04,T06</td><td>E <code>lib/features/notifications/presentation/episode_alert_navigation.dart</code>; E <code>test/features/notifications/presentation/episode_alert_navigation_test.dart</code>; E <code>test/features/notifications/domain/episode_alert_target_test.dart</code></td><td>Direct target/parent/root/publication checks and mounted/generation guards, no autoplay; distant target10001 opens, draft/foreign target denied</td></tr><tr><td>03-T08 / Localization / T01</td><td>E <code>lib/l10n/app_ar.arb</code>; E <code>lib/l10n/app_en.arb</code>; E <code>lib/l10n/generated/app_localizations.dart</code>; E <code>lib/l10n/generated/app_localizations_ar.dart</code>; E <code>lib/l10n/generated/app_localizations_en.dart</code></td><td>Page-scope/loading/retry strings in ARB; generated files only via gen-l10n. Serialize with WO-02 localization owner</td></tr><tr><td>03-T09 / Backend / T01</td><td>N <code>functions/lib/admin-user-count.js</code>; N <code>functions/test/admin-user-count.test.js</code>; E <code>functions/index.js</code></td><td>Aggregate-only callable, server authority/root allowlist, bounded response; guest/owner/other/body-forged-role denial. Export integration order WO-01→WO-03→WO-04</td></tr><tr><td>03-T10 / Admin aggregate / T09</td><td>N <code>web_admin/lib/user-count.ts</code>; E <code>web_admin/components/admin/users-aggregate-view.tsx</code>; N <code>web_admin/test/user-count.test.ts</code></td><td>Replace denied collection count with callable; loading/error/retry without sensitive logging; do not weaken Rules</td></tr><tr><td>03-T11 / Admin query / T01,T02</td><td>E <code>web_admin/lib/admin-query.ts</code>; E <code>web_admin/lib/resource-filters.ts</code>; N <code>web_admin/lib/resource-pagination.ts</code>; N <code>web_admin/test/resource-pagination.test.ts</code>; E <code>web_admin/test/resource-filters.test.ts</code></td><td>Query builder includes root/filter/sort/cursor; page and bounded200 search continuation; red record2001 and synthetic10000</td></tr><tr><td>03-T12 / Admin UI / T10,T11,WO-01 integration</td><td>E <code>web_admin/components/admin/admin-app.tsx</code>; E <code>web_admin/lib/admin-relations.ts</code>; E <code>web_admin/test/admin-relations.test.ts</code>; N <code>web_admin/test/resource-pagination-preview.tsx</code></td><td>Server pages, accurate labels/count/search scope, page-only relation hydration; proposed synthetic preview, no production fake fallback</td></tr><tr><td>03-T13 / Admin export / T12,WO-01 export</td><td>E <code>web_admin/lib/export-excel.ts</code>; E <code>web_admin/test/export-excel.test.ts</code>; N <code>web_admin/lib/export-pages.ts</code>; N <code>web_admin/test/export-pages.test.ts</code>; E <code>web_admin/components/admin/admin-app.tsx</code></td><td>Page/all export binding, parts/manifest/resume/cancel, authorized fields; complete2001+ export on fixed fixture. T12→T13</td></tr><tr><td>03-T14 / Public data / T01,T02</td><td>E <code>web_hudhud/lib/content-repository.ts</code>; E <code>web_hudhud/lib/discovery.ts</code>; N <code>web_hudhud/test/content-pagination.test.mjs</code>; E <code>web_hudhud/test/discovery.test.mjs</code></td><td>Bounded programs/episodes/direct lookup, Map grouping, cache/root/cancellation;10000 red then green read budgets</td></tr><tr><td>03-T15 / Public UI / T14</td><td>E <code>web_hudhud/station-detail.tsx</code>; E <code>web_hudhud/public-home.tsx</code>; E <code>web_hudhud/test/preview.tsx</code>; E <code>web_hudhud/test/preview.html</code>; N <code>web_hudhud/test/content-pagination-ui.test.mjs</code></td><td>Previous/next,≤100 rows, grouping memo only on page change; existing URL links and no autoplay; synthetic10000 fixture</td></tr><tr><td>03-T16 / Integration QA / T04,T09,T11,T14</td><td>E <code>tool/run-admin-emulator-tests.mjs</code>; N <code>web_admin/test/content-pagination.emulator.test.ts</code>; N <code>web_admin/test/user-count.emulator.test.ts</code>; E <code>firebase_tests/firebase-rules/firestore.rules.test.js</code></td><td>Add only count export to isolated harness; both roots, role boundaries/count/2001+/legacy; distinguish emulator from deployed indexes. Rules test serialized with WO-01/WO-04; no Rules source edit</td></tr><tr><td>03-T17 / Independent reviewer / T07,T13,T15,T16</td><td>N <code>.boss/technical-review/WO-03-code-review.md</code></td><td>Reviewer who did not implement changes examines actual diff, ranks concrete findings; unit success cannot waive review</td></tr><tr><td>03-T18 / QA / T17 without blocking findings; external04-T08 and merged-candidate QA</td><td>N <code>.boss/technical-review/WO-03-acceptance.md</code></td><td>Run defined red/green/integration gates, capture call/document/row counts, account for skip identities, verify rollback; close findings only with evidence</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>Each T03–T16 begins with source inspection and a failing regression in its owned test set, then minimal implementation, then green. If interface changes discover further callers through <code>rg 'StationContentRepository|StationContentBatch' lib test</code>, update the write set and conflict graph before dispatch. Do not leave a non-compiling interface migration in an integration commit.</p>
<h2 id="3-before-implementation-checklist">3. Before implementation checklist</h2>
<ul><li>[ ] T01 approved query/search semantics, including public/Flutter tie-order difference.</li><li>[ ] Fresh baseline and Git status; verify every NEW path before creation.</li><li>[ ] Supported Node22 and installed Flutter; no dependency installation planned.</li><li>[ ] Synthetic demo fixtures, production fallback forbidden, invalid root fails closed.</li><li>[ ] Use WO-01 authority-helper contract if changed; no parallel authorization implementation.</li><li>[ ] Execution authority remains bounded by the user session. This planning artifact grants no migration or deployment permission.</li></ul>
<h2 id="4-dependencies-and-evidence">4. Dependencies and evidence</h2>
<h3 id="4-1-parallel-safe-groups-and-shared-ownership">4.1 Parallel-safe groups and shared ownership</h3>
<p>A:T01 alone. B:T02/T03/T08/T09 after T01 with external file locks. C:T04 after T02/T03; T10 after T09; T11/T14 after T02, all disjoint. D:Flutter T05→T06→T07, admin T12→T13, and public T15 may run concurrently only after WO-01/02/04 shared-file locks are resolved. T16 follows its producers; T17→T18 conclude. Writing a red test before a producer is ready does not establish a green contract.</p>
<p>Mandatory shared lanes:</p>
<ul><li><code>web_admin/components/admin/admin-app.tsx</code> and export integration: WO-01→WO-03 T12→T13; one admin integration owner.</li><li><code>functions/index.js</code>: <strong>WO-01→WO-03→WO-04</strong>, one backend integration owner.</li><li><code>firestore.indexes.json</code>: <strong>WO-03 owner</strong>, then WO-04 if needed; integrate additive query shapes without simultaneous writes.</li><li><code>firestore.rules</code>: <strong>WO-01</strong>, then WO-04 in the same integration lane; WO-03 does not edit it.</li><li><code>firebase_tests/firebase-rules/firestore.rules.test.js</code> and <code>tool/run-admin-emulator-tests.mjs</code>: one integration-QA owner, <strong>WO-01→WO-03→WO-04</strong>. Shared contracts follow the same WO-01→WO-03→WO-04 sequence.</li><li><code>lib/app/providers.dart</code> and localization: serialize with WO-02. <code>program_details_screen.dart</code>: serialize with WO-04 comment-count presentation changes; coordinator records exact slot before dispatch.</li></ul>
<h3 id="interim-handoff-without-premature-closure">Interim handoff without premature closure</h3>
<p>WO-03 may provide <strong>INTERIM contract/shared-file handoffs</strong> to WO-04 before03-T18. These handoffs contain the reviewed contract, additive indexes, entry-point export and isolated-harness patches at a recorded integration commit. They are <strong>not</strong> WO-03 closure, complete-wave GREEN or a waiver of any gate. WO-04 waits only for these specific contract/index/entry/harness patch handoffs, never for03-T18 or full WO-03 acceptance.</p>
<p>The external final-acceptance dependency is <strong>04-T08 → 03-T18</strong>: all17 previously skipped integration identities, including the real PL03 new-comment journeys, must execute after04-T08 integrates the actual count worker.03-T18 also requires QA against the merged candidate containing both work orders' necessary patches. There is <strong>no03-T18 → WO-04 dependency</strong>. Failed interim checks return to their owner; unrelated partial handoff cannot be represented as complete acceptance. All17 obligations remain mandatory and all findings remain OPEN until their full closure evidence exists.</p>
<h3 id="4-2-evidence-waves-planned-commands-not-results">4.2 Evidence waves — planned commands, not results</h3>
<p>Commands are argv arrays with separate cwd. Coordinator may mirror these into the master waves registry; this task does not own waves.json. Use Node22 in PATH. RED must fail an expected behavior assertion, not skip or missing-file setup. NEW tests must be authored by their owner before the red invocation.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Wave / owner</th><th>cwd / planned red argv</th><th>Planned green gates</th><th>Contract / stop condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>W03-A contract/data / Data</td><td>root: <code>[&quot;node&quot;,&quot;--test&quot;,&quot;tool/test/content_pagination_migration.test.mjs&quot;]</code></td><td>Same command; missing-field and conditional-restore fixtures; index diff review</td><td>CM03-01/02; stop on unexplained exclusion or overwrite of newer edits</td></tr><tr><td>W03-B Flutter / QA</td><td>root: <code>[&quot;flutter&quot;,&quot;test&quot;,&quot;--no-pub&quot;,&quot;test/features/station_content/data/content_pagination_test.dart&quot;,&quot;test/features/station_content/presentation/station_content_controller_test.dart&quot;,&quot;test/features/notifications/presentation/episode_alert_navigation_test.dart&quot;]</code></td><td>Same; <code>[&quot;flutter&quot;,&quot;test&quot;,&quot;--no-pub&quot;,&quot;test/features/station_content&quot;,&quot;test/features/notifications&quot;,&quot;test/features/station_details&quot;]</code>; <code>[&quot;flutter&quot;,&quot;analyze&quot;]</code></td><td>CM03-01/02/03; stop if101st content missing or stale request affects new selection</td></tr><tr><td>W03-C count/access / Backend QA</td><td>functions: <code>[&quot;node&quot;,&quot;--test&quot;,&quot;test/admin-user-count.test.js&quot;]</code>; root: <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;run&quot;,&quot;emulators:admin&quot;]</code> after T16</td><td>Same; functions <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;run&quot;,&quot;lint&quot;]</code>, <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;test&quot;]</code>; root <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;run&quot;,&quot;emulators:test&quot;]</code></td><td>CM03-04; stop on personal-data exposure, forged authority or skipped integration</td></tr><tr><td>W03-D admin / QA</td><td>web_admin: <code>[&quot;node&quot;,&quot;--experimental-strip-types&quot;,&quot;--test&quot;,&quot;test/resource-pagination.test.ts&quot;,&quot;test/export-pages.test.ts&quot;]</code></td><td>Same; <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;test&quot;]</code>, <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;run&quot;,&quot;lint&quot;]</code>; root emulators:admin</td><td>CM03-05/06; stop if2001 unreachable or partial count labeled complete</td></tr><tr><td>W03-E public / QA</td><td>web_hudhud: <code>[&quot;node&quot;,&quot;--experimental-vm-modules&quot;,&quot;--experimental-transform-types&quot;,&quot;--test&quot;,&quot;test/content-pagination.test.mjs&quot;,&quot;test/content-pagination-ui.test.mjs&quot;]</code></td><td>Same; <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;test&quot;]</code>, <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;run&quot;,&quot;lint&quot;]</code>, <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;run&quot;,&quot;typecheck&quot;]</code></td><td>CM03-01/02/07; stop on full10000 read, unbounded DOM or autoplay</td></tr><tr><td>W03-F independent acceptance / Reviewer+QA</td><td>No new red; review prior wave evidence</td><td>root <code>[&quot;./tool/verify-governance.sh&quot;]</code>, <code>[&quot;dart&quot;,&quot;format&quot;,&quot;--output=none&quot;,&quot;--set-exit-if-changed&quot;,&quot;lib&quot;,&quot;test&quot;]</code>, <code>[&quot;flutter&quot;,&quot;test&quot;,&quot;--no-pub&quot;]</code>, <code>[&quot;flutter&quot;,&quot;build&quot;,&quot;apk&quot;,&quot;--debug&quot;]</code>; each web cwd <code>[&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;run&quot;,&quot;build&quot;]</code> with env <code>VITE_FIRESTORE_ROOT=HudHudDev</code></td><td>All CM; no rootless build/production, no unresolved skipped acceptance</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>T08 additionally uses root <code>[&quot;flutter&quot;,&quot;gen-l10n&quot;]</code> during implementation to regenerate the three listed localization outputs. Builds are future implementation gates and may create derived artifacts; they are not deployments. Browser checks use synthetic sources for RTL, page controls and deep links. Do not claim device playback verification. Independent reviewers must not approve their own implementation.</p>
<h3 id="4-3-contract-matrix">4.3 Contract matrix</h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>UI/copy</th><th>Client payload</th><th>Server/schema</th><th>Persistence</th><th>Business rule</th><th>Planned evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CM03-01</td><td>Page/continue, no complete-archive claim</td><td>root/station/program/filter/cursorVersion/pageSize</td><td>Published parent-valid rows, stable tuple,50(+1)</td><td>Composite indexes; no snapshots in domain</td><td>Every eligible fixed-fixture row reachable; wrong-scope cursor rejected</td><td>T04/T14/T16:101+, ties/missing fields, both roots</td></tr><tr><td>CM03-02</td><td>Link target or unavailable</td><td>canonical station/program/episode IDs</td><td>Direct reads and parent/root/publication/deletion validation</td><td>No writes/full-history reads</td><td>Distant target works, draft/foreign fails, no autoplay</td><td>T07/T15:target10001, incorrect parent/unknown ID</td></tr><tr><td>CM03-03</td><td>offline/refresh/loadingMore/error align</td><td>generation/fingerprint</td><td>Separate cache/server cursor state</td><td>SDK cache only</td><td>Late result never replaces new selection; retry preserves prior page</td><td>Controller delayed-cache/switch-during-loadMore</td></tr><tr><td>CM03-04</td><td>Root account total and asOf only</td><td>root; no body role/UID authority</td><td>Verified claims+known root+aggregate-only</td><td>Count without listing profiles</td><td>guest/owner/other denied; scoped/moderator/super allowed total only; scoped user list still denied</td><td>Count unit/emulator+Rules, both roots, invalidroot/forged claims</td></tr><tr><td>CM03-05</td><td>Server-filter total differs from matched-so-far</td><td>filter/sort/searchMode/cursor</td><td>Root bound before limit; bounded200 search</td><td>No assumed search index</td><td>2001/10000 reachable, no duplicates in fixed fixture</td><td>T11/T12/T16 and browser fixture</td></tr><tr><td>CM03-06</td><td>Page/all export with progress</td><td>filter snapshot/part cursor</td><td>WO-01 authorized projection</td><td>≤1000 records/part+manifest; no new PII store</td><td>Complete only at scan exhaustion; cancel/resume/filter change</td><td>T13:2001+ and authorization fixtures</td></tr><tr><td>CM03-07</td><td>Bounded rows/previous/next</td><td>Requested page</td><td>≤51/query; Map grouping</td><td>No unbounded accumulation</td><td>Clock tick does not regroup whole archive; rows≤100</td><td>T15:synthetic10000 and request/document/row counters</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>T16 access matrix runs under HudHudDev, HudHudOfficial and invalid root: guest; listener owner; different listener; station_admin assigned to station; station_admin assigned elsewhere; moderator; super_admin. Body-forged root/role/UID and fake claims must not elevate authority. Allowed root-level aggregate is independent of station ownership but contains no identity and cannot unlock users listing. Public lookup enforces visibility. Admin list/export preserve existing permissions and WO-01 private-field boundaries; UI filters are not security enforcement.</p>
<h2 id="5-file-summary-and-unresolved-test-evidence">5. File summary and unresolved test evidence</h2>
<p>The task table is the authoritative planned create/edit registry; no deletion or package/lock modification. NEW test commands cannot execute until their task creates those files. Coordinator computes the exact union before dispatch and splits any newly discovered path into a revised owned task. Prior368 passes/17 skips in the review describe the old baseline and do not establish remediation.</p>
