<p>Current harness exports only four callables and no content triggers. T16 adds the new count export. <strong>WO-04 R12 must separately integrate the actual comment-count worker/trigger into the isolated harness before PL03 new-comment tests can be considered green. Do not skip the failing new-comment variant or substitute correctedCounter controls.</strong> The17 identities remain explicit acceptance obligations; SKIP is not PASS.</p>
