.test.ts</code></td><td>HudHudOfficial: new comment journey</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td><code>pl03-moderation.emulator.test.ts</code></td><td>HudHudOfficial: corrected counter control</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td><code>program-transfer.emulator.test.ts</code></td><td>trusted program transfer includes off-page children, races safely with creation and rejects overflow</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td><code>review-report.emulator.test.ts</code></td><td>concurrent moderation resolves off-page reports and decrements once</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td><code>save-authorization.emulator.test.ts</code></td><td>real callable rejects unauthenticated callers and cross-station takeover, and permits own-station edits</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td><code>save-content.emulator.test.ts</code></td><td>actual save transaction preserves retry counters, rejects stale edits and moves atomically in both roots</td></tr></tbody></table>
